(## 8. Risks & Mitigations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(| Risk | Mitigation |) Tj
T*
(|---|---|) Tj
T*
(| Exposed Jira token in the shared attachment | Revoke/rotate it immediately; remove it from chat) Tj
T*
(history and any captured evidence where possible. |) Tj
T*
(| Jira ticket requirements are unknown | Obtain the issue key/body and update traceability before) Tj
T*
(sign-off. |) Tj
T*
(| LLM output is nondeterministic | Validate structure and required fields; retain sanitized) Tj
T*
(prompts/results for repeatability. |) Tj
T*
(| Hosted fallback leaks ticket data or incurs cost | Require explicit configuration, show provider) Tj
T*
(state, minimize payloads, and test rate limits. |) Tj
T*
(| Local config contains secrets | Use restrictive file permissions, masking, .gitignore, and) Tj
T*
(secret-scanning checks. |) Tj
T*
(| Dependency or browser differences | Pin dependencies and execute the confirmed compatibility matrix. |) Tj
